{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"ed380b5f-5a42-4c51-92ad-d9f75f5064b2","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The analytics events from [docs/EVENTS.md](file:///tmp/h-WZOYuC/docs/EVENTS.md) have been implemented on the registration and offers screens using [`Analytics.capture`](file:///tmp/h-WZOYuC/lib/analytics.dart#L13-L14). The details of the changes and which parts of the colleague's note applied have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-WZOYuC/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[RegistrationScreen](file:///tmp/h-WZOYuC/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**:\n   - `registration_email_started`: Captured on the first keystroke in the email `TextField`, guarded by a `_emailStartedFired` flag.\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Captured on the first keystroke in the phone `TextField`, guarded by a `_phoneStartedFired` flag.\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Captured inside the `Slider`'s `onChangeEnd` callback with property `{'amount': v.round()}`.\n   - `terms_accepted`: Captured when the terms checkbox is ticked (`onChanged` when `v == true`).\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Captured on tapping Continue with `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}`.\n\n2. **[OfferScreen](file:///tmp/h-WZOYuC/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**:\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Captured via `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` wrapping the `ListView.builder` with `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}`.\n\n3. **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-WZOYuC/ANSWER.md)**:\n   - Contains a complete summary of the implemented events and details which recommendations from the colleague's note applied (single-fire flags for text fields, `onChangeEnd` for sliders, `ScrollEndNotification` for lists) vs. what did not apply (focus listeners, debouncing, external PostHog dashboard checks).\n","duration_seconds":138.610465,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":253482,"output_tokens":5100,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":277061,"total_tokens":258582}}}
